==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|zëlt}}, from {{inh|de|goh|zelt}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*teld}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*teldą}}.

Compare {{cog|da|telt}} (whence {{cog|en|tilt}} + native {{m|en|tild}} from {{cog|ang|teld}}), {{cog|dum|telt}}, {{cog|non|tjald|t=tent}} (whence {{cog|nb|tjeld}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/t͡sɛlt/}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɛlt|s=1}}
* {{audio|de|De-Zelt.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s}}

# [[tent]], [[marquee]]
